      "body": "Tested the US intl in both test and SIT environment \n\nAre we going to use the below URL to test both environment?\n\n[https://zimmermann-sit.sfdc-8tgtt5-ecom1.exp-delivery.com/en-ca/](https://zimmermann-sit.sfdc-8tgtt5-ecom1.exp-delivery.com/en-ca/)\n[https://zimmermann-test.sfdc-8tgtt5-ecom1.exp-delivery.com/en-ca/](https://zimmermann-test.sfdc-8tgtt5-ecom1.exp-delivery.com/en-ca/)\n\n**Observation:**\n\n(!) Page not found error after page loads\n\n![\"image-20260810-110313.png\"](image-20260810-110313.png)\n\n(!) 412 error console logs\n\n![\"image-20260810-110637.png\"](image-20260810-110637.png)\n\n**_Note:_** *Currency and locale is not testable yet as we do not have specific story yet.*",
