      "body": "US intl SIT and Test Env\n\n[https://zimmermann-sit.sfdc-8tgtt5-ecom1.exp-delivery.com/en-ca](https://zimmermann-sit.sfdc-8tgtt5-ecom1.exp-delivery.com/en-ca)\n[https://zimmermann-test.sfdc-8tgtt5-ecom1.exp-delivery.com/en-ca](https://zimmermann-test.sfdc-8tgtt5-ecom1.exp-delivery.com/en-ca)\n\n|**Storefront**|**Acceptance Criteria**|**Test Env.**|**SIT Env.**|\n|---|---|---|---|\n|✅ US intl|US intl accessible in SIT and Test Environment and page load.|![]([\"image-20260811-061549.png\"](image-20260811-061549.png))[\"image-20260811-061605.png\"](image-20260811-061605.png)|\n|⚠️ ALL Storefronts|412 error upon loading the page|![]([\"image-20260811-061743.png\"](image-20260811-061743.png))[\"image-20260811-061650.png\"](image-20260811-061650.png)|",
