      "body": "Additional products added to SFCC dev environment. \n\n!Screenshot 2026-07-27 at 6.39.15 PM.png|width=384,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-07-27 at 6.39.15 PM.png\"!\n\nCurrently, there’s an issue in storefront for AU. No proudcts are displayed.\n\n!Screenshot 2026-07-27 at 6.41.14 PM.png|width=552,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-07-27 at 6.41.14 PM.png\"!\n\nUser:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac User:557058:a8d3e24a-618f-49c2-a524-9f82f1ad6b1b User:712020:08a6f120-c836-4f71-92db-c97999401c49",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Victor T. Crisostomo",
        "name": "Victor T. Crisostomo",
        "email": "victor.t.crisostomo@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/557058:09af9e5b-661b-42a2-90ec-9ce9f69d324d/0ead87b0-7d31-4296-b27b-4a7b26ac2af1/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-27T20:42:01.862+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-27T20:42:01.862+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13552",
      "body": "User:557058:09af9e5b-661b-42a2-90ec-9ce9f69d324d \n\nRoot cause confirmed — backend, not frontend. Verified twice independently, including once from a network path with zero involvement of the developer's machine or browser.\n\nConfirmed failing repros (guest token):\n\n- GET .../shopper-search/v1/organizations/f*ecom*bkzk_002/product-search?siteId=ZimmermannAU&refine=cgid=clothing&currency=AUD&locale=en&allImages=true\n      - → 500, sfdc_customization: HOOK  this is the actual PLP category from the report\n- GET .../shopper-products/v1/organizations/f*ecom*bkzk_002/products/4673TS251?siteId=ZimmermannAU&currency=AUD&locale=en&allImages=true\n      - → 500, sfdc_customization: HOOK\n- GET .../shopper-products/v1/organizations/f*ecom*bkzk_002/products/8637DS241?siteId=ZimmermannAU&currency=AUD&locale=en&allImages=true\n      - → 500, sfdc_customization: HOOK\n\nRemoving allImages=true from any of the above returns 200 immediately, all\nother params unchanged.\n\nImportant, not a blanket bug: product-search?q=dress&allImages=true (which surfaces 8637DS241 as its only hit) returns 200, repeatedly — so the same product crashes via direct shopper-products fetch but not via product-search.\n\nThis rules out a simple \"the allImages parameter is broken\" explanation and\npoints at a product/category-specific data inconsistency (most likely in\nimage-group configuration) that a hook throws on ungracefully — pinning down the exact field requires access to the actual hook source / raw catalog data, which we don't have visibility into from the Shopper API.\n\nCC: User:557058:1a7fb05a-783b-4241-a0f1-9a7b046da3a8 User:557058:a8d3e24a-618f-49c2-a524-9f82f1ad6b1b User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Marcel Angelo Navarro",
        "name": "Marcel Angelo Navarro",
        "email": "marcel.a.n.navarro@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/482e2e100517026f4980d6455214aa11?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FMN-6.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-28T15:09:22.175+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-28T15:09:22.175+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13564",
      "body": "This story has been completed and is being closed as **Done** for this sprint. The development work is finished and the code is ready for validation.\n\nQA validation will be carried out in the next sprint and a separate validation task has been created to track this activity. [SFCC-265 Magento Sample Product Data - QA Validation - Jira](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-265)\n\nNo further development work is required on this task.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "email": "hazel.marie.i.banaz@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/883ff1fae0c6179bdff495757469823d?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FHC-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-28T20:01:05.874+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-28T20:01:05.874+1000"
    }
  ]
}

